  "description": "The ideal fun machine for riding fast and rough terrains with pace, agility and confidence at your side, the Ragley Mmmbop is a versatile, aggressive and dependable hardtail bike. It features a robust and lightweight alloy frame that's equipped with 150mm travel Marzocchi Bomber Z2 suspension forks and a Shimano Deore M51000 11-speed groupset, a with a wide ranging 11-Speed cassette and hydraulic disc brakes. Plus, it rolls upon Nukeproof Neutron Boost hubs laced into 27.5\" WTB ST i30 Tubeless Ready rims wrapped in Maxxis Minion Wide Trail tyres.\nSlack, Aggressive and Stable Frame Geometry\nThe Mmmbop is here for the fun times. Slack, aggressive and built to hang with any of your full-suspension riding mates. Perfect to ride all-day but drop the saddle and the magic happens…\n150mm Travel Marzocchi Z2 Rail Suspension Fork\nA 63.75-degree head angle inspires confidence on the steeps, the 150mm Marzocchi Z2 Rail provides bucketloads of composure, and the taught frame keeps things tracking no matter what.\nShimano Deore 11-Speed Groupset and Hydraulic Disc Brakes\nThe bike is way more than the sum of its parts, and that’s saying something: this model sees an upgrade to the 11-speed Deore groupset and M6100 brakes. The award-winning Band-X Ascend dropper is a trail essential and tubeless-ready Nukeproof/WTB wheels are the perfect partner for the range-topping Maxxis 3C EXO+ Minion rubber.\nSo, whether you’re entering the hardtail category at an enduro race, exploring a backcountry epic or just smashing around the local woods, the Mmmbop is ready for anything.",
